<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
  <meta name="description" content="마루웰 앱 고객지원 및 문의 안내" />
  <title>고객지원 | 마루웰</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6f8fc;--card:#fff;--line:#dbe3ef;--text:#0f172a;--muted:#64748b;
      --yellow:#ffc400;--yellow-deep:#f3b700;--blue:#2563eb;--kakao:#fee500;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{margin:0;min-height:100%;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
      font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Noto Sans KR",Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif}
    body{padding:24px 14px 48px}
    .wrap{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto}
    .hero,.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px}
    .hero{padding:30px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
    .mark{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:15px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffd83a,var(--yellow));
      display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:1000;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.06em;
      box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(255,196,0,.22)}
    .brand-name{font-size:20px;font-weight:1000;letter-spacing:.03em}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.045em}
    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;font-size:15px}
    .card{padding:24px;margin-top:12px}
    .card h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.025em}
    .card p{margin:0;color:#475569;line-height:1.75;font-size:14px}
    .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .contact{
      border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;background:#fbfcfe;
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:154px
    }
    .contact .label{font-size:12px;font-weight:900;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.01em}
    .contact .value{font-size:17px;font-weight:900;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.45}
    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:46px;border-radius:13px;
      text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;padding:0 16px;transition:transform .15s ease
    }
    .btn:active{transform:scale(.985)}
    .btn.kakao{background:var(--kakao);color:#191919}
    .btn.mail{background:#eff6ff;color:#1d4ed8}
    .note{margin-top:16px;padding:15px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc;color:#64748b;
      font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}
    .links{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
    .links a{color:#475569;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
    .links a:hover{color:var(--blue)}
    .footer{padding:24px 4px 8px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
    @media(max-width:640px){
      body{padding:12px 10px 36px}
      .hero,.card{border-radius:18px}
      .hero{padding:24px 18px}
      .hero h1{font-size:26px}
      .card{padding:20px 17px}
      .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .contact{min-height:auto}
    }
  </style>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/mw-global-font.css?v=20260925-2" />
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="mark">MW</div>
        <div class="brand-name">MAROOWELL</div>
      </div>
      <h1>마루웰 앱 고객지원</h1>
      <p>마루웰 앱 이용 중 문의사항이나 도움이 필요한 경우 아래 공식 채널로 연락해 주세요.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>문의하기</h2>
      <p>앱 로그인, 계정, 기능 사용, 오류 및 기타 서비스 관련 문의를 접수할 수 있습니다.</p>

      <div class="contact-grid">
        <article class="contact">
          <div class="label">공식 카카오톡 채널</div>
          <div class="value">마루웰 공식 채널</div>
          <a class="btn kakao" href="https://pf.kakao.com/_xcgHxln" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            카카오톡으로 문의하기
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="contact">
          <div class="label">공식 이메일</div>
          <div class="value">maroowell@maroowell.com</div>
          <a class="btn mail" href="mailto:maroowell@maroowell.com">
            이메일로 문의하기
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="note">
        문의 시 사용 중인 앱 버전, 기기 종류, 발생한 화면 또는 오류 내용을 함께 알려주시면 확인에 도움이 됩니다.
      </div>

      <div class="links">
        <a href="/">마루웰 홈</a>
        <a href="/privacy">개인정보처리방침</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="footer">© MAROOWELL · maroowell@maroowell.com</div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
